  "term": "emotional intelligence",
  "definition": "Emotional intelligence is the ability to understand and manage emotions and to use emotional understanding to support thinking and handle tasks effectively. It includes capacities such as empathy, self-awareness, self-regulation, self-motivation, and social skill, and reflects how well a person relates to others.",
